        "cooked": "<p>Sentinels of Freedom has its faults but I’d say it’s voice acting isn’t one of them. Well, okay, some things sound a bit off (I’m really not sure why Unity’s VA decided to attempt an extremely heavy Israeli accent. I mean, I <em>kind</em> of get what she was going for there but I think she went a bit far.) but mostly it’s pretty good.</p>\n<p>So what are some of y’all’s (ooh, double contraction) favorite voice lines from the game. My personal favorites are pretty much anything Absolute Zero says because he’s great.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-12-05T18:32:10.927Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
